            portrait: _("story/winter1.webp"),
            text: _("<span color=' <<'> + _For several days, the healers of the Aethenwood worked feverishly to save as many of the wounded as they were able, both man and elf. The villagers set out to rebuild their homes and bury the dead to the north of the town, where many mounds joined the small garden of graves already there.</span>"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_14",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
