            text: _("<span color=' <<'> + _And thus, man alone stood triumphant in victory over the dead. While years of rebuilding lay ahead for Westin, they’d take place in harmony thanks to Deoran’s leadership and the heroics of the South Guard.</span>"),
          },
        ],
      },
