          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("Some weeks after the battle..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 500,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Garard",
            text: _("<b><i>This</i></b> is the perfect town you promised me, brother?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 250,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "Garard",
            x: 9,
            y: 4,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 250,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Garard",
            text: _("Rubble in the river, blood in the streets, hardly a soul to be seen. And this <b><i>after</i></b> sending one of my brightest young officers? Not so bright after all, I suppose. No, I do not think I shall be investing any more resources in this little project of yours, Arand."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Arand",
            text: _("I must admit... things seem to have somewhat deteriorated. My last visit was barely a year ago, at which time our plan of expansion seemed to be going splendidly."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Garard",
            text: _("This little southern experiment has shown me: there is nothing to be gained settling lands barren and empty. I respect a good fight; lust for one, even. But what glory is there to be won in a listless place like this?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Garard",
            text: _("No. We’ve tried things your way, brother. Now it’s time for mine."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 250,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "Garard",
            x: 10,
            y: 2,
          },
          {
